8. VLDR - Very Low Density Residential
a. Intent: The Very Low-Density Residential land use categories are located generally east of High Plains
Road to transition from greater intensity to less intensity, with generous swaths of native and naturalized
open space areas internal to each parcel. Residential uses allow for large lot estate SFD homes, custom
SFD homes, and semi-custom SFD homes. Portion(s) of VLDR neighborhoods may be gated.
b. General Standards: All provisions of Sections A.1 though A.6 above.
