an integral part of the front elevation.
(b) Single-Family Detached (SFD) and Single-Family Attached (SFA) - The area of the garage door may
not comprise more than 70% of the area of the front elevation, excluding the roof (Exempt from
Sections 3.D.8.b.ii, 3.D.10.e-f, & 4.A.6.a.(i-iii) of this PUD)
(c) Multifamily (MF) Residential per Section 4.A.6.a above.
