which is identified on a plat or other instrument of record as reserved for Open Space or Public Greenway.
b. General Standards: All provisions of Section 3.B.1 through 3.B.3 above.
c. Alternative Uses: The open space boundaries depicted or described in the PUD are conceptual and may be
adjusted or relocated as surrounding development occurs. No depiction or description guarantees adjacency
to open space except as otherwise provided herein.
